invariant: INV-14
file: srv_parser.c
catches: srv_test
reason: the parser stops holding pre_shared_key to the last position, which
  RFC 9846 §4.3.11 requires (rfc9846.txt:2564-2567) because the binder
  covers every byte before the binders list and an extension after it
  would sit outside the binder. test/srv_parser_tests.h puts a padding
  extension after pre_shared_key and requires illegal_parameter.

--- old
    if ((ch->seen & SRV_EXT_PRE_SHARED_KEY) != 0) {
        return srv_refuse(p->alert, ALERT_ILLEGAL_PARAMETER);
    }
--- new
    // pre_shared_key may sit anywhere; nothing reads what follows it.
